                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e52c715-bfec-3504-b328-7b9b1037bd3c",
                        "entry_id": "beb0fcbd-49e3-32e5-876e-4ed205291691",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to separate, part"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e12d626-5805-4bc5-923c-459da011fc3e",
                                "sense_id": "5e52c715-bfec-3504-b328-7b9b1037bd3c",
                                "text": "Пьер вспомина́л, как Эле́н улыба́ясь выража́ла своё неудово́льствие за то, что До́лохов живёт в их до́ме, и как До́лохов цини́чески хвали́л ему́ красоту́ его́ жены́, и как он с того́ вре́мени до прие́зда в Москву́ ни на мину́ту не разлуча́лся с ни́ми.",
                                "translation": "Pierre recalled how Hélène had smilingly expressed disapproval of Dólokhov's living at their house, and how cynically Dólokhov had praised his wife's beauty to him and from that time till they came to Moscow had not left them for a day.",
                                "english": "Pierre recalled how Hélène had smilingly expressed disapproval of Dólokhov's living at their house, and how cynically Dólokhov had praised his wife's beauty to him and from that time till they came to Moscow had not left them for a day."
                            }
                        ]
